  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDPs program for local peace building 2014-2016 - UNDPs program for local peace building</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDPs program f&#xf6;r lokalt fredsbyggande 2014-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia advances towards a sustainable and lasting peace, full satisfaction of human rights and fundamental liberties and a integral human development with cultural relevance.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP har tagit fram en ny strategi f&#xf6;r fredsbyggande i Colombia. Tanken &#xe4;r att de olika insatserna f&#xf6;r fredsbyggnad ska integreras f&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; samordningsf&#xf6;rdelar och d&#xe4;rmed uppn&#xe5; b&#xe4;ttre resultat. Programmet kommer att genomf&#xf6;ras p&#xe5; nationell, regional och lokal niv&#xe5; i ett antal utvalda delar av landet d&#xe4;r UNDP har eller kommer att etablera lokalkontor. Finansieringen kommer att ske i form av en &quot;Basket Fund&quot;, d&#xe4;r olika givare kan kanalisera sina bidrag till hela eller delar av programmet. Sverige f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas bli st&#xf6;rsta bidragsgivare, &#xf6;vriga givare f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas inkludera bl.a. Norge, BCPR samt den colombianska regeringen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP has developed a new strategy for peace building in Colombia. The idea is that the various efforts for peace building should be integrated to achieve economies of scale and improve coordination. The program will be implemented at national, regional and local level in selected areas of the country where UNDP has or will establish local offices. The funding will be managed through a Basket Fund, in which various donors can channel their contributions to the whole or parts of the program. Sweden is expected to become the main donor to the Program, other donors are expected to include, among others, Norway, BCPR and the Colombian government.</narrative>
  </description>
